Blinis
1
Small thick pancakes made with flour, baking powder and milk.
---
Flour|200|g
Baking powder|1|sachet
Salt|0.5|tsp
Eggs|2|pcs
Milk|20|cl
---
Mix the flour with the baking powder and salt. Mix well.
Add the eggs one at a time, mixing with a whisk.
Add the milk gradually while mixing.
Cover and let rest 30 minutes.
Cook the blinis in a pan, in small portions, until golden on both sides.
---
starter
blinis
pancake
---
Medium
Optional microwave
Keep chilled if using fresh toppings
Cutlery or by hand
